WEBVTT

00:13:27.395 --> 00:13:30.256
We have acquired human wisdom
on these questions.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.491
And so, for example,
say the marriage decision,

00:13:32.515 --> 00:13:35.014
which I think is the most
important decision we make.

00:13:35.038 --> 00:13:37.314
Marriage is a 50-year conversation.

00:13:37.338 --> 00:13:41.264
Choose someone you can really
talk to for the rest of your life.

00:13:41.288 --> 00:13:43.451
And you'd better have
purity of communication.

00:13:43.475 --> 00:13:45.957
The second bit of wisdom
that I pass along:

00:13:45.981 --> 00:13:48.605
choose agreeableness, avoid neuroticism.

00:13:48.629 --> 00:13:51.720
The agreeable, kind person
may not seem to be the most exciting,

00:13:51.744 --> 00:13:54.934
but that's really what correlates
to really good marriages.

00:13:54.958 --> 00:13:57.080
What kind of love
do you have for the person?

00:13:57.104 --> 00:13:59.027
Is it philia, which is just friendship?

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:01.550
Is it eros, just a sexual desire?